    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-27-2114749427889979405",
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "今日提示词：把\"单向门\"PR 拆成两个",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "第 1 个 PR 实现全部内容但能轻松回滚（双向门），第 2 个叠在上面的 PR 才真正跨过单向门；也就是 expand/contract，需要时用 feature flag。好处是大 PR 的大部分能先在生产上验证。848 赞。"
        },
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114749427889979405"
        },
        {
          "text": "。单向门的例子他举的是\"合并后会给 10 万/12 万人发邮件的 PR，邮件发出去撤不回\"（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复1",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114753597841854539"
        },
        {
          "text": "、"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复2",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114827895931576535"
        },
        {
          "text": "）。"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114749427889979405"
    },
    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-27-2115035446627459461",
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "agent 最擅长的一类任务：掌握 100% 数据、能自己跑实验、能独立验证、能一步步逼近目标",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "他说这类任务上信任度拉满、结果惊人，还在找一个词来称呼它。433 赞。"
        },
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115035446627459461"
        },
        {
          "text": "。补充：只有部分编码任务属于这类，让 agent 做像素级还原它会搞砸（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115050274515804279"
        },
        {
          "text": "）；agent 读日志、处理文本比人快，但人看图强得多（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115042306474627189"
        },
        {
          "text": "）。"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115035446627459461"
    },
    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-27-2115023694942662985",
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "领域知识很值钱：一个专业词就能解锁 agent 的深层知识",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "他做视频剪辑器时告诉 agent 某些辅音会干扰静音检测，只说了 \"fricative\"（擦音）这个词，agent 就拿出完整国际音标，一起排查哪些辅音最麻烦。694 赞。"
        },
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115023694942662985"
        },
        {
          "text": "。做法细节：静音检测本身是确定性的，再让 LLM 在其上过一遍、按节奏调整剪辑（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115030431208816848"
        },
        {
          "text": "）。"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2115023694942662985"
    },
    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-26-2114407583167705279",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "下一个\"给 agent 用的语言\"应该：像 Rust 一样快、像 Go 一样设计空间小、有史上最严格的类型/验证系统",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "他说 Bend 是有意思的第一步。这是他近期互动最高的帖之一（5073 赞、约 47 万浏览）。"
        },
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114407583167705279"
        },
        {
          "text": "。但他接着说 Bend \"not remotely ready for primetime\"，3–4 个提示词就把它的在线 playground 搞崩了（"
        },
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114408093748736169"
        },
        {
          "text": "）。"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114407583167705279"
    },
    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-26-2114408298489553322",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "形式化证明/验证是关键，语言必须确定性",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "回复里说 \"the formal proof aspect is essential\"（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114408298489553322"
        },
        {
          "text": "）；有人提议把 AI 推理内置进语言，他回 \"coding languages MUST be deterministic\"（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114431890300268920"
        },
        {
          "text": "，185 赞）；对\"纯重构 PR 怎么判定\"和\"那就 C？\"他都回\"需要 formal verification\"（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复1",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114664574464987377"
        },
        {
          "text": "、"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复2",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114711217969512948"
        },
        {
          "text": "）；\"agent 以后直接写二进制\"他说是 insane take（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114636323940184524"
        },
        {
          "text": "）。"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114408298489553322"
    },
    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-26-2114432666103931215",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "新课最后一节讲\"软件工厂\"：完全用 GitHub Actions 搭一个基础版，逐个点名每个部件，指出 GitHub 替你藏了多少复杂度，再带大家头脑风暴怎么搭自己的工厂",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114432666103931215"
        },
        {
          "text": "（正文到 \"build your own factory,\" 为止，后面没读到）。有人问不用 GitHub 怎么办，他说 GitHub 只是好搭的具体演示，基础设施可以自己定（"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114452754378662313"
        },
        {
          "text": "）。"
        }
      ],
      "url": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114432666103931215"
    },
    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-26-2114436829130686647",
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "人审放在哪：每扇单向门都审，双向门可以自动合并",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "回答\"人审在工厂哪一环\"。"
        },
        {
          "text": "回复",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2114436829130686647"
        },
        {
          "text": "。"
