    {
      "id": "matt-notes-2026-10-23-2113264229453033684",
      "date": "2026-10-23",
      "source": "matt-notes",
      "title": "代码才是中心，spec 不是",
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "原话 \"The code, not the spec, should be the center of your universe\"；回复里补充 \"Code is executable, spec is not\"，并把代码看成 agent 运行的环境：烂代码就像烂编译结果。"
        },
        {
          "text": "原帖",
          "href": "https://x.com/mattpocockuk/status/2113264229453033684"
